-- A per-player timer. You never pick its slot: the linker allocates one and declares it.
-- @ptimer p_second default=1

-- A fragment is a loop body a module adds to a block (here the TICK block, which the
-- modules create between them). Two fragments with the same loop are fused into one trigger.
-- @fragment TICK.score
-- @loop player
current_player.p_second.set_rate(-100%)
if current_player.p_second.is_zero() then
   current_player.score += 1
   current_player.p_second = 1
end
